[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17947.69, "timestamp": "04:59:07", "text": "そこが問題なんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17964.31, "timestamp": "04:59:24", "text": "2026年3月末。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17967.03, "timestamp": "04:59:27", "text": "これは私がこれから行う重大な宣言です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17970.788, "timestamp": "04:59:30", "text": "ほら、ある意味これは私を制限することになるから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17976.788, "timestamp": "04:59:36", "text": "多くの。もっと制限したくない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17980.39, "timestamp": "04:59:40", "text": "誰かが2,000ドルを寄付したらどうなるか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17983.19, "timestamp": "04:59:43", "text": "私にとって、あるいは何か。何が起こるのですか？おお、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17985.19, "timestamp": "04:59:45", "text": "いいえ。いや、そんなことは絶対に起こらない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17989.19, "timestamp": "04:59:49", "text": "でも考えてみて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17992.868, "timestamp": "04:59:52", "text": "兄弟、もし誰かが私に強制したら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17996.31, "timestamp": "04:59:56", "text": "終わりジョー、私は永遠に彼をボンと鳴らすつもりだから"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17997.175, "timestamp": "04:59:57", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "when that happens we happy"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17999.27, "timestamp": "04:59:59", "text": "多くの。しかし、そんなことは決して起こらないだろう。"}]